# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview of AI skills for Qiskit quantum computing workflows."
msgstr "Ringkasan skill AI untuk alur kerja komputasi kuantum Qiskit."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit AI skills"
msgstr "Skill AI Qiskit"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit AI skills {#qiskit-ai-skills}"
msgstr "Skill AI Qiskit {#qiskit-ai-skills}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Qiskit AI skills repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) has a set of skills that you can use with AI assistants, such as Bob, Claude, or ChatGPT. An AI skill is a reusable set of instructions that teaches the assistant how to complete a specific task.  Skills can help save time and ensure that repeatable tasks are done consistently and correctly.  \n"
msgstr "[repositori skill AI Qiskit](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) memiliki sekumpulan skill yang bisa kamu gunakan dengan asisten AI, seperti Bob, Claude, atau ChatGPT. Skill AI adalah sekumpulan instruksi yang dapat digunakan kembali yang mengajarkan asisten cara menyelesaikan tugas tertentu.  Skill dapat membantu menghemat waktu dan memastikan bahwa tugas berulang dikerjakan secara konsisten dan benar.  \n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use a Qiskit AI skill, follow the instructions for your AI assistant.  In general, you just need to give the skill to the assistant, then tell it where to apply the skill.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menggunakan skill AI Qiskit, ikuti instruksi untuk asisten AI-mu.  Secara umum, kamu hanya perlu memberikan skill tersebut ke asisten, lalu memberi tahu di mana skill tersebut harus diterapkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation {#installation}"
msgstr "Instalasi {#installation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These skills follow the [Agent Skills](https://agentskills.io/) standard and can\n"
"be installed into compatible AI coding agents using the [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills), through\n"
"native agent plugin marketplaces, or by cloning the repository.\n"
msgstr ""
"Skill ini mengikuti standar [Agent Skills](https://agentskills.io/) dan bisa\n"
"diinstal ke agen coding AI yang kompatibel dengan [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills), lewat\n"
"marketplace plugin bawaan agen, atau dengan meng-clone repositori.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick start {#quick-start}"
msgstr "Mulai cepat {#quick-start}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The easiest way to install is with the [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills):\n"
msgstr "Cara termudah untuk menginstal adalah dengan [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills):\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This will prompt you to pick which agent(s) to install for and whether to install globally or just for the current project.\n"
msgstr "Perintah ini akan meminta kamu memilih agen mana yang mau diinstal skill-nya, dan apakah diinstal secara global atau hanya untuk proyek saat ini.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
