msgid "Claude Code {#claude-code}"
msgstr "Claude Code {#claude-code}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install using the [plugin marketplace](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/discover-plugins#add-from-github):\n"
msgstr "Instal lewat [marketplace plugin](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/discover-plugins#add-from-github):\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Codex {#codex}"
msgstr "Codex {#codex}"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cursor {#cursor}"
msgstr "Cursor {#cursor}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from the Cursor marketplace if available, or use the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) above with `--agent cursor`. See [Cursor plugins docs](https://cursor.com/docs/plugins) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Instal dari marketplace Cursor kalau tersedia, atau pakai [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) di atas dengan `--agent cursor`. Lihat [dokumentasi plugin Cursor](https://cursor.com/docs/plugins) untuk info lebih lanjut.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"
msgstr "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bob has no plugin/marketplace step — it reads `SKILL.md` files directly from `.bob/skills/` in a cloned project. The repository symlinks the skills to `.bob/skills/<name>`  so cloning the repo is sufficient.\n"
msgstr "Bob tidak punya langkah plugin/marketplace — Bob membaca file `SKILL.md` langsung dari `.bob/skills/` di proyek yang di-clone. Repositori ini membuat symlink skill ke `.bob/skills/<name>`  jadi cukup dengan meng-clone repositorinya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also install with the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) above with `--agent bob`.\n"
msgstr "Kamu juga bisa menginstal dengan [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) di atas dengan `--agent bob`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone / Copy {#clone--copy}"
msgstr "Clone / Salin {#clone--copy}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your agent does not support a native plugin or the skills CLI, clone this repo and copy the desired skill directory to the agent's supported skill directory:\n"
msgstr "Kalau agen kamu tidak mendukung plugin bawaan atau skills CLI, clone repo ini lalu salin direktori skill yang kamu mau ke direktori skill yang didukung agen:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
